[  467.7s] NOTE DECISION Service errors: Any error (HTTP not 200, or returnCode not '1', or no answer) goes to an agent, never the main menu. cards.list/cards.balance/e-mail services: “Şu anda işleminizi gerçekleştiremiyorum, sizi müşteri temsilcimize aktarıyorum.” Statement-week services: “Şu anda hesap kesim tarihinizi değiştiremiyorum, sizi müşteri temsilcimize aktarıyorum.” cards.list 404 FB_IVR_CHANNEL_102 is the no-eligible-card case. [sources: service-contract §3, §4; 2026-10-08 analysis §2, §6, §7, §8.3, §10; emails/2026-09-24 Q7; meetings/2026-10-07 00:26] CONFLICT: none
[  467.7s] NOTE DECISION Slow service / timeout: Say “Bilgilerinizi kontrol ediyorum.” and keep waiting. No timeout is set, and answers above 10 s can still succeed (test customer 94907600 has a 12 s delay). [sources: service-contract §4, §7.1; 2026-10-08 analysis §8.3, §11.2; test-customers.json delaySeconds] CONFLICT: Wait time still open (Freya to propose). Doubt recorded.
