[  467.7s] NOTE DECISION Same name / same last four: Same name → ask last four. Same last four → “Son dört hanesi [rakamlar] olan birden fazla kartınız var. Kartınızın son altı hanesini söyler misiniz?” Same last six (or last six masked in the data) → “Son altı hanesi aynı olan birden fazla kartınız var. Kart numaranızı söyler misiniz?”, matched on the visible digits. [sources: meetings/2026-10-07 00:13-00:15, 00:24; emails/2026-10-09 point 4 and Deniz's reply; 2026-10-08 analysis §3.2; service-contract §5.1] CONFLICT: 2 Sep analysis went straight to the full number. With masked test data the last six cannot be compared (Mert's note in §3.2), so the agent falls through to the full-number step.
