[  467.7s] NOTE DECISION Statement by e-mail address: Only the registered ibanEmail. Read it back and ask “Ekstrenizi … adresine göndermemi ister misiniz?”. Send only after a clear yes, and say “Ekstreniz kayıtlı e-posta adresinize gönderildi.” only after DONE. Never take or change an address. [sources: emails/2026-09-24 Q3; 2026-10-08 analysis §6; service-contract §5.7; example-scenarios Ex.4] CONFLICT: FAQ says any address the customer gives; contract backend does not check. Selin's rule wins.
